    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Using this plugin, you can create redirects for any post types or taxonomies.</p>\n<p>How to use:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In the &#8220;Tools&#8221; menu, find the &#8220;Htaccess Redirect&#8221; menu item.</li>\n<li>Select the post types and taxonomies for which you want to create redirects.</li>\n<li>In the &#8220;New site domain&#8221; field, enter the URL of the site to which the redirect will be made.</li>\n<li>Click the &#8220;Generate&#8221; button.</li>\n<li>Insert the generated redirects at the beginning of the .htaccess file.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Unzip and upload the &#8220;redirects-for-htaccess&#8221; to the &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/&#8217; directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to the &#8220;Htaccess Redirect&#8221; page in the &#8220;Tools&#8221; menu.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 6.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 6.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Init release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Generates redirect code for .htaccess file",
    "description": "<p>Using this plugin, you can create redirects for any post types or taxonomies.</p>\n<p>How to use:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In the &#8220;Tools&#8221; menu, find the &#8220;Htaccess Redirect&#8221; menu item.</li>\n<li>Select the post types and taxonomies for which you want to create redirects.</li>\n<li>In the &#8220;New site domain&#8221; field, enter the URL of the site to which the redirect will be made.</li>\n<li>Click the &#8220;Generate&#8221; button.</li>\n<li>Insert the generated redirects at the beginning of the .htaccess file.</li>\n</ul>\n",
